    {
      "source": "The <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> that was injected into this test instance\nvia <a href=\"#setApplicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\"><code>setApplicationContext(ApplicationContext)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过<a href=\"#setApplicationContext(org.springframework.context.ApplicationContext)\"><code>setApplicationContext(ApplicationContext)</code></a>注入到此测试实例中的<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Set the <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> to be used by this test instance,\nprovided via <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContextAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContextAware</code></a> semantics.",
      "translation": "设置此测试实例使用的<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>，由通过<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContextAware.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContextAware</code></a>语义提供。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Concrete subclasses should typically declare a class-level\n<a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@ContextConfiguration</code></a> annotation to\nconfigure the <a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">application context</a> <a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html#locations()\">resource locations</a> or <a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html#classes()\">component classes</a>.",
      "translation": "具体子类通常应声明一个类级别的<a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@ContextConfiguration</code></a>注解，以配置<a href=\"../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\">应用上下文</a>的<a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html#locations()\">资源位置</a>或<a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html#classes()\">组件类</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This class serves only as a convenience for extension.",
      "translation": "该类仅作为扩展的便利工具。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Logger available to subclasses.",
      "translation": "可供子类使用的 Logger。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If you wish to extend this class and use a runner other than the\n<a href=\"SpringRunner.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4\"><code>SpringRunner</code></a>, you can use\n<a href=\"rules/SpringClassRule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.rules\"><code>SpringClassRule</code></a> and\n<a href=\"rules/SpringMethodRule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.rules\"><code>SpringMethodRule</code></a>\nand specify your runner of choice via <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runner/RunWith.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runner\"><code>@RunWith(...)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "如果您希望扩展此类并使用除<a href=\"SpringRunner.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4\"><code>SpringRunner</code></a>之外的其他运行器，您可以使用<a href=\"rules/SpringClassRule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.rules\"><code>SpringClassRule</code></a>和<a href=\"rules/SpringMethodRule.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4.rules\"><code>SpringMethodRule</code></a>，并通过<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://junit.org/junit4/javadoc/4.13.2/org/junit/runner/RunWith.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.runner\"><code>@RunWith(...)</code></a>指定您选择的运行器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "If you do not wish for your test classes to be tied to a Spring-specific\nclass hierarchy, you may configure your own custom test classes by using\n<a href=\"SpringRunner.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4\"><code>SpringRunner</code></a>, <a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@ContextConfiguration</code></a>,\n<a href=\"../TestExecutionListeners.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@TestExecutionListeners</code></a>, etc.",
      "translation": "如果您不希望将测试类绑定到 Spring 特定的类层次结构，您可以使用 <a href=\"SpringRunner.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit4\"><code>SpringRunner</code></a>、<a href=\"../ContextConfiguration.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@ContextConfiguration</code></a>、<a href=\"../TestExecutionListeners.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@TestExecutionListeners</code></a> 等配置自定义测试类。",
      "count": 2
    },
